; MW1's arctic Instant Action map 2 (FIXES.md item 44): the vehicles, laid from the ground of the converted c4b
; (the 32 m survey): the company starts on the flat ice south-east of the domed base, facing north-west towards
; the warehouses; four pairs of enemies hold the east, the north, the west snowfield and the north-east, each on
; its own patrol net (net_0N for Enemy_0N; the lancemates on net_09). A record's first item is its net.
; p6, p8, p9 and p10 are MW3's own Instant Action values (its commonest for an enemy; the lancemates' own): without p8
; a pilot is asleep until the player is within its sight, standing with no orders run (FIXES 149).
